<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu rises to 4.639 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu rises to 4.639 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu rose to 4.6390 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6455 on June 13.</p>
<p>				   June 16     June 13</p>
<p> lei per dollar		4.6390	4.6455</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	   800,000     230,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
